Source: dot-os-archive-keyring
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: DOT OS project <maintainers@dot-os.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gnupg
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: dot-os-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: signing key and source entry for the DOT OS package archive
 Installs the public key that DOT OS packages are signed with and an APT
 source entry for the DOT OS archive, so theme updates arrive with
 apt upgrade. The entry ships switched off until the archive is published;
 set "Enabled: yes" in /etc/apt/sources.list.d/dot-os.sources to use it.
